---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Your bots, in better company" description="A workspace for Telegram bot records, configuration, files and teams. Videl is under development.">
  <div class="container"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-content"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> A WORKSPACE FOR WHAT YOU BUILD</div><h1>Your bots.<br/>Your <em>space</em><br/>to build.</h1><p class="hero-lede">Bring your Telegram bot records, configurations, files and team together. Start with what you have; build toward what’s next.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="/app" class="button">Open Studio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/features" class="text-link">Explore the platform <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="honest-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> Videl is under development. Hosting providers, AI and several advanced tools are not available yet.</p></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="Abstract illustration of connected project components, not a product screenshot"><div class="art-label"><span>YOUR WORKSPACE</span><span>AN IDEA TAKING SHAPE ↗</span></div><div class="art-canvas" aria-hidden="true"><div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="art-line line-one"></div><div class="art-line line-two"></div><div class="art-center"><span>v.</span><small>YOUR WORKSPACE</small></div><div class="art-node node-one"><i>01</i><b>bot records</b><span>↗</span></div><div class="art-node node-two"><i>02</i><b>your files</b><span>↗</span></div><div class="art-node node-three"><i>03</i><b>your team</b><span>↗</span></div></div><div class="art-footer"><span>ONE PLACE, MANY POSSIBILITIES</span><span>01 / 03</span></div></div></section>
  <div class="ticker"><span>THE WORKSPACE</span><p>Thoughtful tools for the work around your bots.</p><a href="/features">SEE WHAT'S HERE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <section class="section feature-section"><div class="section-intro"><div><span class="section-index">01 / THE ESSENTIALS</span><h2>Less juggling.<br/><em>More making.</em></h2></div><p>Organize the pieces you already use, with a clearer view of what’s available and what’s still being built.</p></div><div class="features"><article><span class="feature-number">01 <span>↗</span></span><div class="feature-icon">▦</div><h3>A space to work</h3><p>Keep bot records and workspace settings together. Organize team access with roles and permissions.</p><a href="/features">Explore workspaces →</a></article><article><span class="feature-number">02 <span>↗</span></span><div class="feature-icon">⌘</div><h3>Bot configuration</h3><p>Register an existing bot and manage supported configuration and command metadata in one place.</p><a href="/telegram-bot-hosting">Meet bot management →</a></article><article><span class="feature-number">03 <span>↗</span></span><div class="feature-icon">▤</div><h3>Room for your files</h3><p>Explore File Store records and the available media tools, subject to your workspace permissions.</p><a href="/developer-tools">Explore the tools →</a></article></div></section>
  <section class="workflow"><div class="workflow-heading"><span class="section-index">02 / GETTING STARTED</span><h2>From Telegram<br/>to your workspace.</h2><p>Start with a bot you already have. Videl does not create bots through BotFather or deploy them automatically.</p><a class="text-link" href="/documentation">Read the getting started guide →</a></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Get a one-time key</h3><p>Send <code>/web</code> to your Videl bot in a private Telegram chat.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Open your workspace</h3><p>Sign in using the key or open the supported Telegram Mini App.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Connect an existing bot</h3><p>Create it with BotFather first, then register its record in Studio.</p></div></li></ol></section>
  <section class="section coming"><div><span class="section-index">03 / THE ROAD AHEAD</span><h2>Ambitious ideas.<br/><em>Honest progress.</em></h2></div><div><p>We're working toward a more complete development platform. These are future capabilities, not services you can connect today.</p><div class="coming-list"><a href="/cloud-hosting"><span>01</span> External cloud hosting <small>PLANNED ↗</small></a><a href="/ai-development"><span>02</span> AI development tools <small>PLANNED ↗</small></a><a href="/developer-tools"><span>03</span> Secure coding & testing <small>PLANNED ↗</small></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="final-cta"><div><span class="section-index">YOUR NEXT IDEA STARTS HERE</span><h2>Make room<br/>for what’s next.</h2><p>Bring your existing Telegram bot into a workspace built around the way you work.</p></div><a class="button button-dark" href="/app">Open Studio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section></div>
</Layout>
